# CVE-2026-73566: node-tar DoS via crafted long-path tar archive.
# This is npm's own internally bundled tar, not a project dependency
# (confirmed: no "tar" entry in backend/package-lock.json).
# No fix available yet even in the latest npm release as of 2026-09-11.
# Risk accepted: only exercised by `npm install`/`npm ci` at image build
# time, never invoked by the running application.
CVE-2026-73566
